'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page two of the [[Borderline Justice Premium Warbond#Page 2|Borderline Justice]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|25|notext}} and 7 [[Medal]]s.

== Trivia ==
The set was mistitled as ‘Covering Fire’ in the Borderline Justice [[Borderline Justice Premium Warbond#/media/File:Borderline Justice Premium Warbond Overview.jpg|marketing overview]].

